      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 141,
      "npc" : "Rmimi Ravies",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Rmimi Ravies]",
      "translation" : "[爾米米·拉維斯]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 142,
      "npc" : "Rmimi Ravies",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I don't know how you obtained that flower, but if you're not capable of leading others.. then you cannot continue.",
      "translation" : "我不知道你是怎麼得到那朵花的，但如果你沒有能力領導他人...那你就無法繼續了。"
