      "npc" : "Rmimi Ravies",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Too tough?",
      "translation" : "太難了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 146,
      "npc" : "Rmimi Ravies",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Well, what can you do, that's part of the job.",
      "translation" : "唉，沒辦法，這也是工作的一部分。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 151,
      "npc" : "Rmimi Ravies",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Rmimi Ravies]",
      "translation" : "[爾米米·拉維斯]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 152,
      "npc" : "Rmimi Ravies",
      "state" : "translated",
